# Summon: Bahamut ({9}) is cast on turn 3 with Black Lotus, four Moxen and a Sol Ring. As it enters it gets a lore counter
# (CR 714.3a): chapter I destroys Bot2's Ornithopter. After Bot1's draw on turn 5 it gets another (CR 714.3b): chapter II
# is "up to one", Bot2's Island is a land and so refused as a target, and Bot1 chooses none, so Mox Jet stays. On turn 5 Bot1
# also casts Smaug the Magnificent (mana value 4). Chapter III on turn 7 draws two cards. Chapter IV on turn 9 deals damage
# equal to the total mana value of Bot1's OTHER permanents to each opponent: Smaug 4 + Sol Ring 1 + the Moxen 0 and the Treasure
# tokens 0 = 5 (Bot2 15; counting the 9-mana Saga itself would make 14). It is then sacrificed (CR 714.4).

